## Product Facts & Metrics
- TrackingMCP: 234 ocean carriers, 121 direct connectors, 186 SCACs, DCSA events, observed ETAs, D&D free-time, port congestion, AIS (4 feeds, 110,000+ positions), 0–5 min freshness. Free tier: 5 active containers, 100 calls/mo.
